      "en": "He said to David, “You are more righteous than I; for you have done good to me, whereas I have done evil to you.",
      "ko": "다윗에게 이르되 나는 너를 학대하되 너는 나를 선대하니 너는 나보다 의롭도다",
      "source_text_hash": "d8c52cfaa59d8df6a69cc1fa0d1dbf7ef5a29d73d43fabd1f1424983e309aa97",
      "translation_text_hash": "e0ac9ec7ac7e8e46ccebb4c4cd523d0ea21e59d18d1260b5ba8e7d39ec52f02c",
